{
    "title": "Dream House Design: Tile Match",
    "description": "\ud83c\udfe1 Are you a fan of home design and addicted to tile-matching games? If the answer is yes, you must not miss this game! Welcome to Dream House Design, a brand new home design game that melts with tile puzzle games in it. Get ready to immerse yourself in the ultimate design experience! \ud83e\udde9\u2728\r\n\r\nUnlike any other \"home design\" game out there, we've combined the joy of tile-matching with the creativity of interior decorating. Pass the match-3 levels to get coins to buy pretty furniture, and enjoy the journey of your home design makeover. It will give you a feeling of calm, and also exercise your eyesight and brain power.\r\n\r\n \ud83d\udecb\ufe0f\ud83d\udca1\r\nKey Features:\r\n\ud83e\udde9 Countless match-3 levels to keep you endlessly entertained!\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 Lavish decor and exquisite furniture for visual satisfaction.\r\n\ud83c\udfe0 The sharp contrast between before and after renovation will give you spiritual satisfaction.\r\n\ud83e\uddf0 Enhance your design prowess and draw inspiration you can apply in real-life spaces.\r\n\ud83c\udfae Two games in one\u2014combine match-3 excitement with home design creativity for double the joy!\r\n\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Dive into the world of Dream House Design now and make your design dreams a reality! \ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udfe0",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udfe1 Are you a fan of home design and addicted to tile-matching games? If the answer is yes, you must not miss this game! Welcome to Dream House Design, a brand new home design game that melts with tile puzzle games in it. Get ready to immerse yourself in the ultimate design experience! \ud83e\udde9\u2728<br><br>Unlike any other &quot;home design&quot; game out there, we&#39;ve combined the joy of tile-matching with the creativity of interior decorating. Pass the match-3 levels to get coins to buy pretty furniture, and enjoy the journey of your home design makeover. It will give you a feeling of calm, and also exercise your eyesight and brain power.<br><br> \ud83d\udecb\ufe0f\ud83d\udca1<br>Key Features:<br>\ud83e\udde9 Countless match-3 levels to keep you endlessly entertained!<br>\ud83c\udfc6 Lavish decor and exquisite furniture for visual satisfaction.<br>\ud83c\udfe0 The sharp contrast between before and after renovation will give you spiritual satisfaction.<br>\ud83e\uddf0 Enhance your design prowess and draw inspiration you can apply in real-life spaces.<br>\ud83c\udfae Two games in one\u2014combine match-3 excitement with home design creativity for double the joy!<br><br>What are you waiting for? Dive into the world of Dream House Design now and make your design dreams a reality! \ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udfe0",
